{"text": "```python\ndef left_rotate(n: int, d: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Rotate the 32-bit value n left by d bits.\"\"\"\n    d %= 32\n    return ((n << d) | (n >> (32 - d))) & 0xFFFFFFFF\n\n\n# Example calls:\n# left_rotate(0b00000000000000000000000000001010, 1) == 0b00000000000000000000000000010100\n# left_rotate(0b10000000000000000000000000000000, 1) == 0b00000000000000000000000000000001\n```\n\nCONFIDENCE: 85", "searches": 0, "cmds": 0}